OL,3,GNEWSATwo kittens saved after being left
OL,4,Ain plastic bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo kittens who were abandoned in a
OL,7,Fplastic bag are continuing to recover
OL,8,Fafter being discovered by a dog walker.
OL,10,FByfleet Cat Rescue said four kittens
OL,11,Fwho were about five weeks old were
OL,12,Ffound by a man walking his dog in
OL,13,FAddlestone at about 22:00 BST on
OL,14,FSunday, but two of them had died.
OL,16,FThe two surviving ginger kittens,
OL,17,Fdubbed Peanut and Butter, are now being
OL,18,Ffostered until they are ready to find a
OL,19,Fpermanent home.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
