OL,3,GNEWSATwo kittens saved after being left
OL,4,Ain plastic bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Tait, founder of the cat rescue
OL,7,Fcharity, told BBC Radio Surrey: "I was
OL,8,Fabsolutely shocked, the kittens had no
OL,9,Fchance."
